1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:02,160
Congratulations, everyone.

2
00:00:04,960 --> 00:00:07,920
In 1988, the first time I lived it,

3
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:11,920
Kayo, Hiromi, and Aya Nakanishi disappeared,

4
00:00:11,920 --> 00:00:13,440
and their bodies were found later.

5
00:00:14,640 --> 00:00:16,640
I was too helpless to save anyone.

6
00:00:19,680 --> 00:00:22,640
I tried hard to forget, and I did,

7
00:00:23,520 --> 00:00:26,880
but in the end, I had a big gaping hole in my heart.

8
00:00:26,880 --> 00:00:33,040
These past six years, we've experienced success and failure,

9
00:00:33,040 --> 00:00:34,320
happiness and sadness.

10
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:39,840
Good or bad, the experiences we share fill a void we all have inside of us.

11
00:00:40,960 --> 00:00:42,400
Everyone, even me.

12
00:00:43,280 --> 00:00:46,320
So keep filling it, and you'll enrich your life and others, too.

13
00:00:47,120 --> 00:00:49,600
That's what life's about. Never forget that.

14
00:00:56,880 --> 00:01:08,400
カメラー イラスト

15
00:01:08,400 --> 00:01:10,080
君を待った、僕は待った。

16
00:01:10,960 --> 00:01:14,000
途切れない明日も過ぎたって。

17
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:17,080
立ち止まって、振り返って。

18
00:01:17,240 --> 00:01:20,080
止めどない今日を嘆きあった。

19
