49
00:03:39,080 --> 00:03:42,080
Nice meeting you, but I have to go now.

50
00:03:42,080 --> 00:03:44,080
Bye, kids.

51
00:03:46,080 --> 00:03:47,080
Hold up!

52
00:03:47,080 --> 00:03:48,080
Kazu?

53
