63
00:04:23,080 --> 00:04:25,080
Leveling up's a pain in the nuts!

64
00:04:25,080 --> 00:04:26,080
That's what makes games fun!

65
00:04:26,080 --> 00:04:27,080
Hey, Satoru.

66
00:04:27,080 --> 00:04:31,080
Aya's gonna be at the park soon, so maybe we should start heading over.

67
00:04:31,080 --> 00:04:32,080
