78
00:05:06,080 --> 00:05:07,080
Yep.

79
00:05:07,080 --> 00:05:09,080
We'll cruise by the hideout later.

80
00:05:09,080 --> 00:05:11,080
Well, guys, see you then!

81
00:05:12,080 --> 00:05:13,080
Later days, Teach!

82
00:05:14,080 --> 00:05:15,080
