83
00:05:16,080 --> 00:05:18,080
I can't picture Aya and Kazu liking each other.

84
00:05:18,080 --> 00:05:19,080
Yeah, me neither.

85
00:05:19,080 --> 00:05:22,080
But the good thing is, she's always got someone with her now.

86
00:05:22,080 --> 00:05:23,080
Mm-hmm.

87
00:05:25,080 --> 00:05:26,080
Um, you guys, I...

88
00:05:26,080 --> 00:05:28,080
