90
00:05:30,080 --> 00:05:34,080
I think it's awesome how you're going around and making sure none of us are alone.

91
00:05:34,080 --> 00:05:36,080
Both of my parents work.

92
00:05:36,080 --> 00:05:39,080
And nothing felt worse than me getting home and the house being empty.

93
00:05:40,080 --> 00:05:45,080
It's pretty awesome how you kept Kaio and Aya and me from being alone all the time.

94
00:05:46,080 --> 00:05:47,080
