251
00:11:33,360 --> 00:11:34,460
It's nothing bad.

252
00:11:34,580 --> 00:11:35,680
We're just plain detective.

253
00:11:36,300 --> 00:11:38,560
We pretend there's a kidnapper at large.

254
00:11:38,780 --> 00:11:41,400
Then we try to find girls who seem like they're lonely

255
00:11:41,400 --> 00:11:42,780
and make friends with them.

256
00:11:43,520 --> 00:11:44,340
If anything,

257
00:11:44,520 --> 00:11:46,360
we could end up stopping a real kidnapping.

258
00:11:47,120 --> 00:11:47,820
My God.

259
00:11:48,220 --> 00:11:49,300
It might be just a game,

260
