281
00:12:32,760 --> 00:12:33,200
Really?

282
00:12:33,700 --> 00:12:34,080
Bait?

283
00:12:34,080 --> 00:12:35,840
So you're out to catch someone.

284
00:12:36,480 --> 00:12:38,440
Now I know why you were working so hard

285
00:12:38,440 --> 00:12:39,520
